    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_natural_dyestuffs; land_basis=terrestrial_forest): Heading is explicitly a dyewood (fustic, Brazil wood, sapan, Nicaragua wood, red/Guinea wood, braziletto); filed with Dye Woods Logwood (htc:0096) rather than building timber. Layer-1 observations: 42 rows, 1800–1863. Series: HCPP_Annual Statement of Trade ×40; KEW_CUST 5 ×2. Units: Tons ×42. Top routes: World → United Kingdom ×7; Other Parts → United Kingdom ×6; Mexico → United Kingdom ×6; New Granada → United Kingdom ×5."@en ;
